# This app does NOT load .env files at runtime.
# Add DEEPSEEK_API_KEY as a GitHub Actions Secret.
# Optional GitHub Actions Variables/Secrets: DEEPSEEK_API_ENDPOINT and DEEPSEEK_MODEL.
# Legacy aliases AI_API_KEY, AI_API_ENDPOINT and AI_MODEL are also accepted.
# Endpoint default: https://api.avalai.ir/v1
# Model default: deepseek-chat
# Never put a real key in this file, source control, issue comments, or reports.
